This directory holds sealed, oracle-authored acceptance slices, one
subdirectory per milestone (e.g. `ms-11/`), each `include!`d from
`quadraui/tests/acceptance.rs`. See quadraui#556.

Workers must not create, edit, or delete anything under this directory —
slices here are authored independently as part of each milestone's Gate A
sign-off (`coord gate-a --approved`), not by a Work dispatch. This file
exists only to keep the empty directory present in git before the first
slice lands.
